From: PupJune2 <PupJune2@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0000
Subject: CromIKO for Windows: new tab page

The CromIKO new tab page on the desktop, like the Android one, for every
search engine: Chromium's new tab page (whose Google logo, search box and
Google bar Cromite already turns off) is now the new tab page with any
search engine, instead of the plain page of shortcuts that Chromium shows
when the search engine is not Google.

- The CromIKO logo, the mascot and the wordmark, takes the place of the
  Google logo. Like the Google logo it is single-colored on dark themes,
  background images and the colors of Customize Chrome, while the star
  keeps its periwinkle. The mascot floats up and the star twinkles when
  the pointer is on it.
- Under the shortcuts, the shield card: the number of ads and trackers
  that the ad blocker blocked since Monday, from the same counts as on
  Android (cromiko_shield_stats.cc), with a small chart of the days of
  the week. It opens the ad blocker settings.
- Then the CromIKO shortcuts: Bookmarks, Downloads and CromIKO DNS, with
  the CromIKO icons.

The logo is generated by tools/cromiko/gen_desktop_art.py.

